---
import Layout from '../../../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../../../../../styles/ai.css';
---

<Layout
  title="Grok 4.5 — xAI — Rycode"
  description="Grok 4.5 on the xAI API."
  variant="ai"
>
  <article class="ai-model">
    <p class="ai-model-kicker">Frontier models</p>
    <h1 class="ai-model-title">Grok 4.5</h1>
    <p class="ai-model-dek">Available on the API. Aliases: grok-4.5-latest, grok-build-latest. Model id: grok-4.5.</p>
    <hr class="ai-model-rule" />

    <h2 class="ai-model-section">Training</h2>
    <p>Parameter count, cutoff, FLOPs, dataset mix: UNKNOWN on the model page used here unless the live SKU page states a cutoff. Do not invent.</p>

    <h2 class="ai-model-section">Inference</h2>
    <p>Text, image → text. Reasoning supported. Batch: not supported.</p>

    <h2 class="ai-model-section">Context</h2>
    <p>500k context. Max output tokens: UNKNOWN.</p>

    <h2 class="ai-model-section">Pricing</h2>
    <p>Per 1M tokens, as published on docs.x.ai/developers/models, 13 Sep 2026.</p>
    <div class="ai-model-table-wrap">
      <table class="ai-model-table">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th scope="col">Band</th>
            <th scope="col">Input</th>
            <th scope="col">Cached</th>
            <th scope="col">Output</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>&lt; 200k</td><td>$2.00</td><td>$0.30</td><td>$6.00</td></tr>
          <tr><td>≥ 200k</td><td>$4.00</td><td>$0.60</td><td>$12.00</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <h2 class="ai-model-section">Benchmarking</h2>
    <p>UNKNOWN. Do not invent scores.</p>

    <h2 class="ai-model-section">Hardware</h2>
    <p>Per-SKU silicon: UNKNOWN. See <a href="/ai/hardware/memphis-colossus/">Memphis / Colossus</a> for the training campus, not Terafab.</p>

    <h2 class="ai-model-section">Sources</h2>
    <ul class="ai-model-sources">
      <li><a href="https://docs.x.ai/developers/models/grok-4.5">grok-4.5</a> (fetched 13 Sep 2026)</li>
      <li><a href="https://docs.x.ai/developers/models">Models</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://docs.x.ai/developers/pricing">Pricing</a></li>
    </ul>
  </article>
</Layout>
